    text You can create a Bulma table simply by attaching a single table CSS class on a <table> HTML element with the following structure:
    text "<table class=\"table\">" danger
    text container
    text thead the optional top part of the table
    text tfoot the optional bottom part of the table
    text tbody danger
    text content
    text tr danger
    text row
    text th a table cell heading
    text td a table cell
    text You can set a table row as selected by appending the is-selected modifier on a <tr>
    text Example
    table Pos Team Pld W D L GF GA GD Pts Qualification
